    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on some year-end stuff for our manufacturing plant. Can you walk me through the straight-line depreciation calculation for a piece of equipment? It cost $150,000, has an estimated salvage value of $25,000, and a useful life of 10 years. Just need to see the steps to make sure my spreadsheet is right.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
